{"id": "xinjing_jiumo", "type": "Text", "title": "摩诃般若波罗蜜大明咒经", "title_zh": "摩诃般若波罗蜜大明咒经", "translator": "鸠摩罗什", "category": "般若部类", "volume": "", "juan_count": 1, "actual_char_count": 368, "canon_ref": "T.250", "taisho": "T0250", "vehicle": "大乘", "mode": "显教", "translation_place": "", "time_from": 402, "belongs_to_school": ["般若", "中观宗", "三论宗"], "parallel_translations": [], "kepan": {"序分": [], "正宗分": ["c000"], "流通分": []}, "chapters": [{"id": "c000", "chapter_no": 1, "chapter_title": "正文", "section_type": "章节", "part_of_kepan": "正宗分", "paragraphs": ["p00000", "p00001", "p00002", "p00003", "p00004"], "gathas": [], "mantras": [], "figures": ["p103", "p203"], "doctrines": ["c002", "c005", "c008", "c011"], "char_count": 360}], "paragraphs": [{"id": "p00000", "chapter_id": "c000", "para_no": 1, "text_preview": "观世音菩萨，行深般若波罗蜜多时，照见五阴空，度一切苦厄。", "char_count": 28, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": ["p103"], "doctrines": ["c011"]}, {"id": "p00001", "chapter_id": "c000", "para_no": 2, "text_preview": "舍利弗，色空故，无恼坏相；受空故，无受相；想空故，无知相；行空故，无作相；识空故，无觉相。何以故？舍利弗，非色异空，非空异色，色即是空，空即是色，受想行识亦复如", "char_count": 82, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": ["p203"], "doctrines": []}, {"id": "p00002", "chapter_id": "c000", "para_no": 3, "text_preview": "舍利弗，是诸法空相，不生不灭，不垢不净，不增不减。是空法，非过去，非未来，非现在。是故空中无色，无受想行识，无眼耳鼻舌身意，无色声香味触法，无眼界乃至无意识界，", "char_count": 158, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": ["p203"], "doctrines": ["c005", "c008"]}, {"id": "p00003", "chapter_id": "c000", "para_no": 4, "text_preview": "三世诸佛依般若波罗蜜故，得阿耨多罗三藐三菩提。故知般若波罗蜜，是大明咒，是无上明咒，是无等等明咒，能除一切苦，真实不虚。故说般若波罗蜜咒曰：", "char_count": 70, "section_type": "咒语引导", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": [], "doctrines": ["c002"]}, {"id": "p00004", "chapter_id": "c000", "para_no": 5, "text_preview": "竭帝竭帝，波罗竭帝，波罗僧竭帝，菩提僧莎呵。", "char_count": 22, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": [], "doctrines": []}], "gathas": [], "mantras": [], "figure_mentions": [{"figure_id": "p103", "name": "观世音菩萨", "chapters": ["c000"], "mention_count": 1}, {"figure_id": "p203", "name": "舍利弗", "chapters": ["c000"], "mention_count": 1}], "doctrine_mentions": [{"concept_id": "c011", "name": "五蕴", "chapters": ["c000"], "mention_count": 1}, {"concept_id": "c005", "name": "空性", "chapters": ["c000"], "mention_count": 1}, {"concept_id": "c008", "name": "涅槃", "chapters": ["c000"], "mention_count": 1}, {"concept_id": "c002", "name": "真如", "chapters": ["c000"], "mention_count": 1}], "translator_note": "译事未入大事年表", "transmission_events": ["event:translation:鳩摩羅什"]}